  "result": "I've made all three fixes, but I haven't run the test suite or type-check.\n\n- **Switching off now sticks:** the endpoint update in `src/server/repositories/webhook-repository.ts` ignored `enabled: false` because it only wrote the value when it was true. It now writes the value whenever it's provided, so switching off and back on both work. New events already skip endpoints that are off.\n- **Queued deliveries for off endpoints:** the delivery job in `src/server/jobs/webhook-delivery-job.ts` now marks a delivery failed when its endpoint is switched off, and counts it as failed. A missing endpoint was already handled that way. Deliveries for endpoints that are still on go out as before.\n- **Endpoint allowance:** `createWebhook` in `src/server/services/webhook-service.ts` now counts every endpoint, on or off, so switching one off no longer makes room for another.",
